Quick start"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The easiest way to get started is to let your agent handle the setup. Paste this repository link int"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"o your agent, or copy the prompt below:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"You'll need Node.js 22+ and the Discord desktop app. Open Discord and sign in before checking your p"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"resence. A default Discord Application ID is included; no bot token is needed."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Prefer to set it up yourself? Install the package and start the service in the background:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then follow the setup instructions for your agent:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Codex\n- Claude Code\n- OpenCode\n- Pi\n- DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Once connected, give your agent a task and check Discord for its activity. Run `adp status` to check"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" the service and Discord connection."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Stop the service with `adp stop`; this clears its Discord activity. To run in the foreground instead"},{"id":"p16s2","text":", use `adp start` and stop it with Ctrl+C. Automatic startup is not configured, so run `adp start -b"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"` again after restarting your computer."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"See the usage guide for installation, configuration, and operation:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Images and display settings\n- Prompts and language\n- Model and service selection\n- Presence layout"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" and manual summaries\n- Session selection and lifecycle\n- Configuration and platform notes"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
